    "customize": [
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "人物關係"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7489,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "原初之龍創造了三月女神與三輪月亮，並將她們升起至天上。在",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 9095,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "text"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "期間，尼伯龍根囚禁了月神們，並將月亮改造成了武器。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7625,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "卡儂是霜月女神——第二輪誕生、同時也是最亮的月亮。夜晚得已因她而有了不滅的寒燈。「霜月」是在",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 9095,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "text"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "中唯一未被摧毀的月亮。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 9338,
        "name": "艾莉亞",
        "desc": "<p>恆月女神。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/04/19/368338997/ce30b9a17f945c536def5f95f32eef47_3425005229805700263.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 9339,
        "name": "桑娜妲",
        "desc": "<p>虹月女神。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/04/19/368338997/5a4d15060c70ece8ddc97b8dc2ff28c8_1143187201626326072.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "卡儂是中間的姐姐。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7476,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "新的月神。艾莉亞、桑娜妲、卡儂將她們的權能賦予她，使她成為了「三月女神」。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7622,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "當原初",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4897,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "text"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "摧毀了人類的文明，包括",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 8939,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "text"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "，卡儂回應了倖存者的禱喚，並引領他們前往",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 8826,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "text"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "。他們稱霜月女神為「烏萊庫塔爾」，並自稱為「霜月之子」，以此向她致敬。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
